note unroll-k65.om under om2 diag (section 1 lines 36-46, errata E4, E6 Q2, E7): error 8 at the token 65
note on line 8, expect=number, obligation=-. Exact stderr exp/unroll-k65-diag.err.
om2 diag
fn main to int
s = ulong 0
c = ulong 0
for i ulong 65 unroll
s = add s i
c = add c 1
end
ret int c
end
